WEBVTT

00:23.020 --> 00:25.580
Rentt's heading back into 
the labyrinth today...

00:27.030 --> 00:33.370
No, he's not supposed to go until 
the kidnapping thing calms down.

00:34.410 --> 00:37.560
It wouldn't kill him to take the day off...

00:38.580 --> 00:42.060
Nah, I suppose that's impossible for him.

02:19.240 --> 02:20.690
Not bad.

02:20.690 --> 02:23.590
I've made some adjustments just for you.

02:23.590 --> 02:26.700
Since I know your habits.

02:27.210 --> 02:29.590
<i>He definitely knows who I am...</i>

02:27.250 --> 02:31.580
<b>A New Weapon
and Power</b>

02:30.140 --> 02:34.760
I've given it the ability to use mana, 
spirit energy, and divinity, just like you asked.

02:34.760 --> 02:36.610
Try it out.

02:36.610 --> 02:37.710
Okay.

02:37.970 --> 02:39.700
First, magic.

02:46.840 --> 02:50.110
Wow... you're a lot stronger now.

02:50.530 --> 02:53.180
Your mana seems way more powerful.

02:53.180 --> 02:56.700
All I can do is try and force 
it into the sword, though.

02:57.130 --> 02:59.750
But I do have some degree of 
control over my spirit energy.

03:10.180 --> 03:11.990
And lastly, divinity.

03:19.490 --> 03:20.870
This is a good sword.

03:20.870 --> 03:23.170
Infusing it with divinity 
didn't harm it at all.

03:23.170 --> 03:26.630
Look... it's sprouted new leaves.

03:27.400 --> 03:29.230
An effect of the divinity?

03:30.130 --> 03:33.270
It's the only thing I can think of...

03:33.270 --> 03:37.130
Hey, how are you able to use divinity?

03:37.130 --> 03:39.890
That's normally given to 
you by the gods, right?

03:40.290 --> 03:44.360
I once repaired a shrine 
that had been abandoned.

03:44.360 --> 03:46.830
You're more of a believer than I thought.

03:46.830 --> 03:48.600
I just felt like doing it 
for some reason, is all.

03:48.600 --> 03:50.890
I don't even know what god it was.

03:52.620 --> 03:55.520
<i>It must've been a lower-ranking 
one, I'm sure.</i>

03:56.060 --> 03:59.560
Hey, can I keep this?

03:59.560 --> 04:02.340
If these sprouts grow, they 
might have divinity in them.

04:02.340 --> 04:04.000
Fine with me.

04:04.000 --> 04:05.060
Thanks.

04:05.890 --> 04:08.050
Can I practice a little more?

04:08.310 --> 04:10.510
Sure. What are you going to do, though?

04:10.510 --> 04:12.240
You've tried everything, haven't you?

04:13.910 --> 04:16.290
I want to try them all at once.

04:19.190 --> 04:20.570
Will this do?

04:20.970 --> 04:21.860
Yeah.

04:22.950 --> 04:25.860
Have you ever heard of Mana-Spirit Fusion?

04:25.860 --> 04:28.230
I've heard rumors.

04:28.230 --> 04:30.810
It's a technique that allows you 
to massively power up your magic

04:30.810 --> 04:33.810
and spirit skills by using 
them both at the same time.

04:33.810 --> 04:35.860
You'd have to be a real master to do that.

04:35.860 --> 04:37.360
Of course.

04:37.360 --> 04:40.710
You screw it up, and your 
body explodes, I've heard.

04:41.800 --> 04:43.430
Want to back out?

04:43.430 --> 04:45.210
No, I'll try it.

04:45.930 --> 04:49.890
<i>An explosion wouldn't be enough 
to kill this body, anyway.</i>

04:49.890 --> 04:50.510
Here.

04:51.470 --> 04:52.960
Use this.

04:52.960 --> 04:55.680
If this breaks in the process, it's no loss.

04:55.950 --> 04:57.110
You're sure?

04:57.110 --> 05:03.620
Yeah. It can't handle divinity, but 
it's a lot cheaper than a new sword.

05:03.620 --> 05:05.280
Perfect for testing.

05:06.420 --> 05:11.770
<i>Okay. First, I put my mana into my sword 
and spirit energy into my hand...</i>

05:13.650 --> 05:15.040
I-Is that...

05:16.090 --> 05:18.370
<i>This is tough...</i>

05:18.370 --> 05:22.460
<i>It's like I'm trying to jam something 
into a box that's already full.</i>

05:23.920 --> 05:26.350
<i>This is bad... I can't keep it up...</i>

05:32.720 --> 05:36.390
Hey... are you going to add 
divinity to what you just did?

05:36.390 --> 05:37.880
That's really dangerous!

05:38.620 --> 05:39.680
I am.

05:46.720 --> 05:48.950
<i>I need power...</i>

05:48.950 --> 05:52.070
<i>If I'm going to be a 
Mythril-class adventurer!</i>

05:58.910 --> 06:00.120
Y-You okay?

06:00.120 --> 06:01.360
That looks like trouble!

06:06.050 --> 06:09.610
Hey, the sword can't take any more of that!

06:26.310 --> 06:27.990
The sword turned into a ball?

06:28.290 --> 06:30.450
I'm sorry... your sword...

06:30.450 --> 06:31.790
It's fine.

06:31.790 --> 06:37.670
Divinity has the power to remove impurity 
and restore matter to its original state.

06:38.190 --> 06:40.900
So you can't use it with a normal weapon,

06:40.900 --> 06:43.120
'cause it'll break the bonds 
holding the it together.

06:43.840 --> 06:49.560
This sword's made to handle divinity, 
but it can't take what you just did.

06:49.560 --> 06:52.650
The most you could do is Mana-Spirit Fusion.

07:00.880 --> 07:04.770
Hey... what do I do if I find an 
enemy I can't defeat with that?

07:04.770 --> 07:08.310
You want me to make you a dozen that 
you just carry around with you?

07:09.070 --> 07:11.150
I don't have the money.

07:11.150 --> 07:12.760
I know that.

07:18.750 --> 07:22.940
<i>I'm gonna need good equipment if 
I'm going to become a Mythril.</i>

07:22.940 --> 07:25.170
<i>I need to make a lot of money.</i>

07:25.170 --> 07:26.540
Please!

07:26.540 --> 07:28.360
It's not happening!

07:28.740 --> 07:29.790
But...

07:29.790 --> 07:32.640
I can't take a job that 
doesn't come from the guild!

07:32.640 --> 07:34.000
It'll cause a huge 
mess for me later.

07:34.000 --> 07:36.860
Please! I'm begging you!

07:36.860 --> 07:38.480
You need to learn when to shut up.

07:38.480 --> 07:40.500
Or do I need to teach you?

07:40.500 --> 07:41.110
Hey.

07:42.050 --> 07:46.180
Wh-Who are you? You look weird...

07:46.450 --> 07:48.130
Let me talk to him.

07:50.800 --> 07:52.880
I think I can take him for all he's worth.

07:55.570 --> 07:57.000
Do what you want with him.

07:57.270 --> 07:58.870
Bye, kid.

07:59.870 --> 08:02.510
He says he'll talk to you.

08:02.510 --> 08:03.870
Um...

08:03.870 --> 08:04.640
Hey.

08:05.330 --> 08:07.660
Who are you?

08:07.660 --> 08:09.000
An adventurer.

08:09.820 --> 08:13.810
I can't promise I'll take the job, 
but I can at least hear you out.

08:13.810 --> 08:15.120
Really?

08:15.120 --> 08:15.910
Yeah.

08:17.330 --> 08:21.670
Please defeat the Lord... 
the Lord of the Lake!

08:22.090 --> 08:24.660
The "Lord of the Lake"?

08:33.140 --> 08:35.340
<i>What a mess this is...</i>

08:35.340 --> 08:38.210
<i>The reward, and the quest itself, 
are both full of problems.</i>

08:38.990 --> 08:42.980
My name is Ryuntus. I'm from Tottsu village.

08:42.980 --> 08:47.680
Right. The one that's several 
days to the east, correct?

08:47.680 --> 08:49.370
You know it?

08:49.370 --> 08:51.730
I've heard they have a strange festival.

08:51.730 --> 08:52.540
Yes.

08:52.990 --> 08:56.770
There's a legend that they once offered 
up a young, beautiful girl whose body

08:56.770 --> 09:00.400
was brimming with mana to the Lord of the 
Lake, in exchange for saving the village.

09:01.260 --> 09:06.350
They still hold a festival once 
a year to remember that day.

09:07.610 --> 09:10.150
But this time the Lord of the 
Lake actually appeared,

09:10.150 --> 09:12.600
and ate the girl who was playing 
the role of the sacrifice!

09:16.050 --> 09:17.110
And...

09:17.110 --> 09:20.050
It's started demanding more sacrifices.

09:20.050 --> 09:22.610
Several of the village 
girls have already died...

09:22.610 --> 09:24.180
I see.

09:24.180 --> 09:25.650
Help us!

09:25.650 --> 09:29.320
The next sacrifice is my little sister!

09:30.730 --> 09:32.240
Please!

09:35.130 --> 09:39.800
<i>Ryuntus's wish is to save his 
sister, not to kill a monster.</i>

09:40.540 --> 09:44.330
<i>There's no need to fight 
the Lord of the Lake.</i>

09:45.480 --> 09:47.130
<i>But...</i>

09:47.130 --> 09:49.510
<i>Something feels really wrong about this.</i>

09:52.280 --> 09:53.990
It's a quiet village.

09:53.990 --> 09:58.960
Yes. It's a small village, but 
it used to be much more lively.

09:58.960 --> 10:04.060
But since the Lord of the Lake appeared, 
everybody's just gotten so tired...

10:08.190 --> 10:10.130
This way, Rentt.

10:10.130 --> 10:11.060
Right.

10:13.990 --> 10:15.320
What's this mark?

10:15.320 --> 10:16.850
It's a sign.

10:16.850 --> 10:22.210
The house with this mark has to be the next to 
offer their daughter up to the Lord of the Lake.

10:22.210 --> 10:24.540
Did the Lord of the Lake put it there?

10:24.540 --> 10:29.840
No, it lives deep in the 
lake. No one's ever seen it.

10:29.840 --> 10:34.090
It was probably put here 
by a Kelpie that serves it.

10:34.090 --> 10:37.950
A <i>Kelpie</i>? That's a powerful monster.

10:37.950 --> 10:39.690
It is?

10:39.690 --> 10:40.850
Brother?

10:41.390 --> 10:43.710
Amiris! I'm back!

10:43.710 --> 10:45.710
This is Rentt, the adventurer!

10:45.710 --> 10:47.910
He's a Bronze-class!

10:48.200 --> 10:49.670
He's going to save you!

10:49.670 --> 10:50.690
Jeez!

10:51.940 --> 10:56.360
Brother, I told you so many times not to 
talk to any weirdos when you went to the city!

10:56.360 --> 10:58.720
But Rentt's a good guy!

10:58.720 --> 11:01.480
You only think that because 
he's tricking you!

11:02.160 --> 11:05.390
He looks like a weirdo to me!

11:05.640 --> 11:07.190
<i>That's really mean...</i>

11:07.190 --> 11:11.490
<i>I can hear every word since my senses 
got better when I became a monster...</i>

11:13.350 --> 11:15.430
You're Rentt, the adventurer, right?

11:15.430 --> 11:16.550
Yes.

11:16.550 --> 11:21.230
Thank you for listening 
to my foolish brother.

11:21.230 --> 11:23.060
No, it's fine.

11:23.640 --> 11:29.580
But the festival of Tottsu village 
is an ancient tradition.

11:29.580 --> 11:32.290
I can't selfishly ask to be 
the one girl excused from it.

11:32.290 --> 11:33.630
Amiris!

11:33.630 --> 11:37.770
Please, forget what he asked you, and leave.

11:38.690 --> 11:41.460
I was hired by Ryuntus.

11:42.200 --> 11:45.610
Only Ryuntus has the right 
to rescind the request.

11:47.850 --> 11:50.480
I'm not rescinding it! Ever!

11:53.270 --> 11:57.740
If you're going to be staying in 
this village, please use our home.

11:57.740 --> 12:01.240
But please don't interfere 
with the festival.

12:01.860 --> 12:05.540
I'm glad to become the sacrifice.

12:07.780 --> 12:10.160
I'm sorry my sister's so stubborn.

12:10.460 --> 12:12.780
The festival's tomorrow night?

12:12.780 --> 12:13.940
Yes.

12:13.940 --> 12:18.440
From the look of it, Amiris is not 
going to run if we tell her to.

12:20.270 --> 12:21.550
What will you do?

12:22.350 --> 12:24.960
I know it's very dangerous.

12:24.960 --> 12:29.800
But if there's any chance my sister 
can be saved... I'll do anything!

12:29.800 --> 12:32.390
So please!

12:37.640 --> 12:40.210
Hey, mister, what are you selling?

12:40.210 --> 12:42.320
This is dried meat.

12:43.290 --> 12:44.780
And this?

12:44.780 --> 12:49.060
Dried fruits. Here, try some.

12:49.060 --> 12:50.380
Really?

12:50.380 --> 12:51.990
It looks so good!

12:51.990 --> 12:55.830
But I do have a request...

12:55.830 --> 12:56.990
What is it?

12:56.990 --> 13:01.280
Tell your parents to buy something.

13:01.280 --> 13:04.760
I can't sell anything 
because nobody's coming!

13:04.760 --> 13:05.610
Okay!

13:05.610 --> 13:06.830
I'll tell them!

13:06.830 --> 13:08.290
Great. Eat up.

13:08.290 --> 13:09.900
Thank you!

13:10.890 --> 13:14.520
I'm sorry... I want to ask you something.

13:15.760 --> 13:16.980
A monster!

13:16.980 --> 13:17.680
A mons-

13:17.680 --> 13:18.810
He'll eat us!

13:18.810 --> 13:21.550
I've never seen you in this village before.

13:21.550 --> 13:23.480
Here for the festival?

13:23.480 --> 13:25.450
Something like that.

13:25.450 --> 13:27.770
You came at a bad time, then.

13:27.770 --> 13:31.580
The Lord of the Lake is angry right now.

13:32.740 --> 13:37.250
And so the villagers have better things 
to do than buy my wares, I guess!

13:37.250 --> 13:38.450
I see.

13:38.450 --> 13:39.820
Rentt!

13:39.820 --> 13:41.590
Lunch is ready!

13:41.950 --> 13:43.090
Okay!

13:43.090 --> 13:45.620
Sorry to interrupt your business.

13:45.620 --> 13:47.540
It's fine.

13:47.540 --> 13:50.990
You should give up on the 
festival and head back to town.

13:50.990 --> 13:52.000
All right.

13:52.380 --> 13:54.780
Did you get to take a look at the lake?

13:54.780 --> 13:55.720
Yeah.

13:55.720 --> 13:58.860
Anyway... does that merchant come often?

13:58.860 --> 14:04.050
Yes. They stop here often. 
It's quite nice of them.

14:04.610 --> 14:06.160
I see.

14:15.740 --> 14:18.710
Forgive us, Amiris.

14:18.710 --> 14:21.510
No, don't apologize.

14:21.510 --> 14:23.920
The Lord was the one who chose me.

14:24.450 --> 14:29.640
I was sure Ryuntus would 
take you and run away...

14:30.380 --> 14:36.970
He was telling everybody we 
should call off the festival...

14:36.970 --> 14:38.340
He was?!

14:38.690 --> 14:44.270
If we make the Lord angry, it could 
easily destroy this village!

14:44.270 --> 14:51.770
He was so desperate... he was worried about 
you, but also the future of this village.

14:54.180 --> 14:57.130
He really is such a fool...

15:09.180 --> 15:11.760
Amiris, can we talk?

15:11.760 --> 15:14.100
No! Don't come in!

15:14.100 --> 15:16.890
The sacrifice must not
 meet others so casually!

15:17.320 --> 15:19.880
All right. Then I'll say it here.

15:20.790 --> 15:22.470
I'll take care of things.

15:23.650 --> 15:26.940
There's always a way.

15:26.940 --> 15:28.220
But...

15:28.220 --> 15:29.820
I'm serious.

15:29.820 --> 15:31.650
So you must struggle, too.

15:32.180 --> 15:35.900
Struggle? How?

15:35.900 --> 15:38.370
No human could defeat the Lord of the Lake!

15:38.880 --> 15:42.280
Ryuntus and I will handle 
the Lord of the Lake.

15:42.280 --> 15:45.000
That's impossible!

15:45.000 --> 15:48.870
Amiris, don't do anything 
to make your brother sad.

15:49.280 --> 15:51.490
He's all the family you have, isn't he?

15:52.930 --> 15:54.350
So struggle.

15:54.700 --> 15:56.630
As long as there's hope...

15:57.180 --> 15:59.380
That's all I wanted to say.

16:05.620 --> 16:06.820
Thank you.

16:08.390 --> 16:12.960
Our Lord, who protects us from 
the bottom of the lake...

16:12.960 --> 16:20.140
Each time the horns of your servants 
leave their mark, we make our sacrifice.

16:20.140 --> 16:24.450
One sacrifice of treasure, 
one, of our daughters.

16:24.450 --> 16:27.850
When the azure light guides,

16:27.850 --> 16:32.390
protect us from disaster...

16:33.250 --> 16:34.800
I'm sorry, Amiris.

16:34.800 --> 16:36.610
We must do this to protect the villlage.

16:36.610 --> 16:38.750
I know, sir.

16:38.750 --> 16:41.720
Do your duty well.

16:47.890 --> 16:49.110
Let's go.

16:49.110 --> 16:49.840
Right.

16:50.520 --> 16:52.690
Amiris, are you ready?

16:53.240 --> 16:55.930
Yes. Let's go.

17:08.750 --> 17:10.550
Rentt! The fog!

17:10.550 --> 17:13.800
Yeah. It appeared at just the right time.

17:13.800 --> 17:16.360
I can't see a thing...

17:16.360 --> 17:17.970
Let's turn back!

17:19.030 --> 17:20.270
The orb...

17:20.270 --> 17:23.390
Looks like our "Lord" has 
made his appearance.

17:24.520 --> 17:26.350
Rentt, there's something there!

17:31.300 --> 17:33.730
This is the Lord of the Lake?

17:34.680 --> 17:37.770
Lord, please, calm your anger!

17:37.770 --> 17:40.960
Protect the village! Protect the village!

17:39.460 --> 17:40.960
Stop, Amiris.

17:40.960 --> 17:41.990
You're wasting your time.

17:41.990 --> 17:45.160
I'll sacrifice myself... I'll 
sacrifice myself, so...

17:46.110 --> 17:47.210
The orb!

17:47.430 --> 17:49.370
It's just a beacon, nothing more.

17:50.120 --> 17:51.210
Hang on to the ship!

17:53.990 --> 17:55.870
He's floating on the water?!

17:55.870 --> 17:59.490
<i>It's nice to have a friend 
who's an alchemist.</i>

18:02.360 --> 18:06.720
Now, then... let's show this 
"Lord" for what he really is.

18:09.430 --> 18:12.140
<i>Krakens are normally found in the ocean.</i>

18:12.140 --> 18:13.670
<i>They don't spit fire, either.</i>

18:15.730 --> 18:16.880
<i>What?</i>

18:18.510 --> 18:21.020
It's that weirdo from this afternoon!

18:21.020 --> 18:22.380
<i>Just like I thought.</i>

18:23.290 --> 18:28.360
<i>A mage cast an illusion on the fog, 
and then fired Fortia Bolivus.</i>

18:29.660 --> 18:34.830
If you'd just left, you wouldn't 
have lost your precious life.

18:34.830 --> 18:39.120
To think the Lord of the Lake was 
just an ugly traveling merchant.

18:39.900 --> 18:42.550
I've already lost my life once, anyway.

18:42.550 --> 18:45.090
What the hell are you talking about?

18:57.710 --> 18:59.280
Rentt!

18:59.750 --> 19:02.150
I'm fine. It's over.

19:02.690 --> 19:04.860
What's that ship?

19:05.640 --> 19:07.330
What is happening?

19:11.880 --> 19:15.750
Amiris? Is that true?

19:15.750 --> 19:16.260
Yes.

19:16.530 --> 19:20.640
They pretended to be the Lord, 
and demanded sacrifices!

19:20.640 --> 19:22.740
How awful...

19:22.740 --> 19:25.810
Rentt, did you realize from the start?

19:25.810 --> 19:28.150
I did think it was suspicious.

19:28.150 --> 19:32.620
A monster that's been worshipped as the Lord 
of an area doesn't just go out of control.

19:32.620 --> 19:35.880
Hey! Where are the other girls?

19:38.180 --> 19:39.320
Answer them!

19:39.320 --> 19:40.960
They're alive!

19:40.960 --> 19:43.770
We were going to sell them for 
a fortune in another land!

19:43.770 --> 19:46.190
They're all alive, right?

19:46.190 --> 19:48.840
There's a small hut on the 
other side of the lake.

19:48.840 --> 19:50.090
That's where they are!

19:50.790 --> 19:52.120
Get a carriage ready!

19:52.120 --> 19:53.580
We need to go save them!

19:53.580 --> 19:54.420
Right!

19:55.300 --> 19:58.780
Ryuntus, this means the 
job is complete, correct?

19:58.780 --> 20:00.480
Yes, of course!

20:04.290 --> 20:08.070
We're doing the festival 
over. Stay and watch it.

20:08.070 --> 20:11.020
He's right. You don't 
have to leave so soon.

20:11.020 --> 20:14.520
Sorry. Someone's waiting for me in Maalt.

20:15.510 --> 20:17.420
Too bad, then.

20:18.170 --> 20:23.100
Rentt, I won't forget how you 
saved the village, and Amiris.

20:23.100 --> 20:24.700
Thank you.

20:24.700 --> 20:26.750
You're welcome. Be well.

20:26.750 --> 20:28.580
Yes, take care!

20:28.580 --> 20:30.010
Rentt!

20:36.500 --> 20:38.800
Amiris, what did you...

20:38.800 --> 20:40.880
I just wanted to thank him, is all!

20:42.080 --> 20:43.010
Thank me, huh?

20:43.490 --> 20:45.960
Then I shall gladly accept your thanks.

20:51.770 --> 20:56.550
<i>Those kidnappers said they didn't 
grab anyone but women...</i>

20:57.300 --> 21:00.810
<i>They seem to have nothing to do with 
the kidnappings of new adventurers</i>

21:00.810 --> 21:02.670
<i>that Sheila talked about...</i>

21:04.450 --> 21:08.300
I see. So Ryuntus's sister was saved, then?

21:08.300 --> 21:09.240
Yes.

21:09.240 --> 21:11.730
And the other girls are all safe, too.

21:11.730 --> 21:13.260
Excellent.

21:13.630 --> 21:15.870
It's thanks to the magic item you lent me.

21:16.250 --> 21:19.140
It's nice to be able to 
walk on water, isn't it?

21:19.140 --> 21:20.290
Yeah.

21:20.680 --> 21:25.660
If it was real, I would've loved 
to see the Lord of the Lake.

21:25.660 --> 21:27.570
You were right not to go.

21:27.570 --> 21:29.620
You had a rush job, right?

21:30.800 --> 21:32.720
By the way, Rentt.

21:34.460 --> 21:38.930
You stole the heart of another 
girl you saved, didn't you?

21:39.380 --> 21:41.420
Of course not.

21:41.420 --> 21:44.060
I did get a thank you, though.

21:44.060 --> 21:45.570
A thank you, huh?

21:47.150 --> 21:49.340
I'm sure she'll...

21:49.340 --> 21:52.720
She'll forget me before much 
time has passed at all.

21:54.600 --> 21:56.860
That's how it is when you're an adventurer.

21:59.880 --> 22:02.890
The gods should punish 
you a little, I think.

23:35.720 --> 23:40.010
Dragonblood Flower
